    rdf:value """Wednesday, Aug. 21, 1907
2 Morpeth Terrace.
Dull. Cold.
Same party.
I came up rather late, to dentist.
Strong called for B.B. and they drove to the Rosegg and lunched and walked back. Strong regards religion as a deplorable weakness. Tea with Mme Greffulhe and Matilde Serao, etc.
Dined with  Sassoons and Lamberts ."""^^xsd:string ;
    mbdiaries-ontology:index 255 ;
    mbdiaries-ontology:part_of <https://mbdiaries.itatti.harvard.edu/resource/diary/1907> .

